     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe introductory distance sampling workshop (06-17 October 2025) filled more than half the available spaces in the first two weeks of registration. Registration closes in just over three weeks (26 Sept 2025). If you are considering taking the workshop, I encourage\r\n you to act swiftly to avoid disappointment. If you know a colleague who might benefit from the workshop, please pass this information along to them.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nComplete details and link to the St Andrews Online Shop for registration is below:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a title=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html\" href=\"https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471497649000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0FNWIA-zcOcTKoRjdvw9tO\">https://distancesampling.org/training/announcements/intro-oct-2025.html</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_MSFontService&q